ask(c,'Under the lecture’s convention, what distinguishes shallow from deep MLPs?', ['One hidden layer versus multiple hidden layers','One output class versus multiple output classes','No bias versus at least one bias','Small learning rate versus large learning rate'],['The stated distinction concerns hidden-layer count.','Class count is an output-design choice.','Bias presence is not the depth definition.','Learning rate is an optimization hyperparameter.'],locator='Shallow and deep explanation')
