ask(c,'With learned parameters held fixed, what does a forward pass do?', ['Computes predictions through successive affine maps and activations','Subtracts the loss gradient from every weight','Chooses the learning rate from the target label','Computes only the target label and ignores input features'],['It evaluates the current model; parameter updates occur in a separate stage.','That is an optimizer update.','Learning rate is not determined by a forward prediction rule.','The input drives the prediction.'],assumptions=['Ordinary deterministic feedforward model; no parameter or running-state updates during this evaluation.'],locator='No learning in forward propagation')
